  "slug": "cyber-punk",
  "name": "Cyber Punk",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automated security vulnerability scanner for Claude Code. Fetches CVE/CWE data from NIST NVD, scans code for vulnerable patterns across 9 languages (JS/TS, Python, Go, Java, Rust, PHP, Ruby, C/C++), generates proof-of-concept exploit scripts, and produces detailed security reports with root cause analysis (WHY/HOW/WHAT) for each finding.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `cyber-punk` (Use when analyzing project security, checking for CVE/CWE vulnerabilities, scanning for insecure code patterns, generating exploit PoCs, or…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cyber-punk@claude-community` from `bonciarello/cyber-punk`.",
